      <h3 class="section-heading">Twelve foundational moves</h3>
      <p class="glossary-core-atoms-lede">
        Two resting stalls and ten basic moves are the foundation the
        dictionary teaches from, though not every trick breaks down into them.
        Each card describes the move; open a panel for how it compares with its
        neighbours.
      </p>
      <div class="glossary-core-atoms-grid">
        {{#each content.coreAtomEducationalCards}}
